          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉદ્દેશ — uddeś — \"a purpose\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આ યોજનાનો ઉદ્દેશ ગામમાં પાણી લાવવાનો છે. ā yojnāno uddeś gāmmā̃ pāṇī lāvvāno che. The aim of this plan is to bring water to the village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉદ્દેશ (uddeś) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit uddeśa, \"pointing at, an aim\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
